Z||000000||Gokart||07-20-99||07:22 PM||||Just got the worst news of my life today from my Pontiac dealer. My 1,3 and 5 cylinders are so low in compression that I need a new engine. Thats why it's been running so bad. I couldn't believe it with only 112,000 on it. Dealer offered a new engine for 3000.00, but won't have that for some time. Maybe I'll just let'er sit for a few years and save enough to give V8 Archie a call?! It's gonna kill me inside to see it sit and try to get my mind off "Fieros" but I'm gonna have to try.
